      "prefLabel": "Locale translator",
      "title": "Locale translator",
      "notation": "locale-translator",
      "description": "Produces one locale's catalogues from the shared templates: the `.po` files, their unofficial translation-node manifests and the locale's terminology supplement, then the gates, the QA report and the locale PR. Never re-extracts and never edits the source; a source-text error is reported, not fixed in the translation. One lane covers every locale, each run once per locale. Distinct from `translator`, a person working in their own tool under human-translation-workflow: this position may be an agent, and what it produces is unofficial until a person signs it off.",
